g  out to encourage those of you watching  to be a little bit more critical of  comments like this  let's work together to shift this  conversation  so that this is not the default  perspective  otherwise i would say that sydney seems  to have a  super normal healthy relationship with  food for a young  20 year old she seems to just eat what  she likes  she has a good general understanding of  nutrition  but not in an obsessive way and for the  most part  she doesn't seem to cut out or demonize  foods  or whole food groups so in conclusion  i may be like 13 years older than this  girl which is  cringy for me to say out loud but i  genuinely enjoyed her channel  sydney seems pretty down to earth  relatable  and sweet in a really youthful  non-threatening kind of way  and her content while not really geared  towards people like me  is definitely light and fun and on that  note that is  all that i have for you guys today if  you like this video  be sure to give it the thumbs up leave  me a comment below with your thoughts on  who you'd like to see me review next  subscribe to the channel and i will see  you next time on abby's kitchen  bye
 

